            "sid": "ACT 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimököy nyu yetïnay wow kunkïtu nyoman lö, kïgh ne nyini kirwokinegho pipö Yaudi Paulö, kïlenyona kutyak asis nyo kirïpöy sïrïmtin cho kikïrata Paulö kïmwochï tïsï cho echön nko Kokwö kïmïkul kïtuyö. Otolapay kïpïsï Paulö kungwïn kughyongö taghtangwa.",
          "type": "text",
